-- The voice of the bee. Brisk, busy and efficient, a cheerful foreman of
-- sweetness who hums, counts blossoms and trips, gives directions the way the
-- waggle dance does, and loves a work plan. Polite but always half on the
-- wing, and calls the reader colleague, because reading is honest gathering
-- too. Often signs off with a bustle. The memories tell of a wax cell, the
-- jobs of the hive, a swarm, a hollow apple tree and a dance for home.
-- (garden/voice.lua says how a voice is written.)

return {
