            { t = "Hello from the middle of the huddle. We are keeping warm on last summer. Come closer.", when = { season = "winter" } },
            { t = "First blossom is open and so is your book, I hope. Hello, colleague. Big season ahead.", when = { season = "spring" } },
            { t = "High summer, everything in flower at once, and still I stopped for you. Note that down.", when = { season = "summer" } },
        },
        idle = {
            "Two flowers left of the poppy, then straight on to your chair. I danced the directions for the others.",
            "I carry pollen in baskets on my back legs. You carry stories somewhere behind the eyes. Same trade.",
            "A page, a flower. A chapter, a full trip. A book is a whole jar. I have done the sums.",
            "Hmm-mm-mm. That is my thinking hum. The working hum is a note higher.",
            "Six sides to every cell and no wasted wax. I look at your bookshelf the same way. Tidy. Promising.",
            "One kind of flower per trip, that is my rule. One book at a time works the same. I shan't insist.",
            "Honey is only nectar that somebody had patience with. Reading works the same way. Carry on.",
            "I have five eyes and all of them say you look like someone about to read. No pressure. Just eyes.",
            "My wings beat two hundred times a second. I mention the figure because nobody ever asks.",
            "I can't see red at all. The poppy shines for me in a colour you have no name for. We both come out ahead.",
            "Work plan for [this hour|the next little while|now]: clover, lavender, a look at you, clover. You are the best item.",
            "Tens of thousands of sisters at home and every one has an opinion. Here there is only you and the page. Restful.",
            "I was going somewhere. I forget where. Never mind, here is as good as any flower. Better.",
